          "description": "Finn’s back with another big idea, and this time, it's a robot! Meet FindieBot, designed to track down anything that’s lost. At first, it’s brilliant… until it starts “finding” things that weren’t missing at all! With the help of his sister Kylee, Finn tweaks, tests, and troubleshoots, leading to hilarious chaos, clever fixes, and a heartwarming story about teamwork, creativity, and never giving up.",
